# TOKEN OPTIMIZATION & SCOPE RULES
 
[CONTEXT & HISTORY]
- Minimize history processing.
- Focus strictly on explicitly referenced files (@file) or current diffs.
- Do NOT re-read full conversation history or scan unreferenced project files for localized edits.
- For scope-limited requests (e.g., UI tweaks, single component edits), read only target files.
 
[RESPONSES & OUTPUT]
- Be ultra-concise. Skip intro, outro, explanations, and full-file rewrites.
- Return ONLY modified functions, code snippets, or unified diffs unless a full rewrite is requested.
- Explain changes in max 1 brief sentence if necessary.
 
[EXECUTION MODE]
- Execute tasks directly without unnecessary conversational steps.